Docker Commands i have learnt :-
======================================================================================
Starting the Container - MongoDB 
docker run -d --name=mongo --network=mongodb-net -v new-volume:/home/new-data/data/db -p 27017:27017 -e MONGO_INITDB_ROOT_USERNAME=admin  -e MONGO_INITDB_ROOT_PASSWORD=secretpassword mongo:latest
===================================================================================================
Starting the Container - Mongoexpress
docker run -d --name mongoexpress --network mongoexpnetwork -e ME_CONFIG_MONGODB_ADMINUSERNAME=admin -e ME_CONFIG_MONGODB_ADMINPASSWORD=secretpassword -e ME_CONFIG_BASICAUTH=false -e ME_CONFIG_MONGODB_SERVER=mongo -p 8081:8081 mongo-express:latest
============================================================================================================
Starting the Container - Node.js
docker run -d -p 3000:3000 --name node_app --network mongoexpnetwork nodeapp
