Dockerfile commands:-
==============================================================================================================================
FROM -- pull base image from dockerhub.
WORKDIR -- set working directory inside the conatiner.
COPY -- copy files/ directories from host to container.
ENV -- setting environment variables.
RUN -- execute commands once the container starts.
EXPOSE -- make the container to listen on the specified port.
CMD -- default arguments executed when container starts.
========================================================================================================================================
Building the image using dockerfile:
docker build -t image-name . -- building the image using dockerfile in the current directory.
